Benchmarks in this folder are extracted from the Open Source project Gale
https://github.com/pulseengine/gale

Many thanks to the owner of the Gale project, Ralf (@avrabe).

We extracted every executable/proof functions in the Rust/Verus-verified
portaion of gale (i.e., in its src folder).
We skipped the ones that do not require any proof annotations.

|
--benchmarks (verified version of each task; original proof from Ralf contained)
--unverified (all proof annotations removed)
--unverified_nolemma (one task used helper lemma in the original proof; we removed that helper lemma)
